    this way. If Summoned this way, this card gains 800 ATK for each Normal Monster
    shuffled into the Deck for its Summon. Once per turn, you can target 1 monster
    on the field and 1 non-Effect Monster in your GY; destroy that monster on the
    field, and if you do, Special Summon that other monster from your GY.
